{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "demolition_destroyed_lot",
  "spec": ["demolition 4.5", "demolition 6", "demolition 12.4"],
  "description": "A 3x2 lot in state 6 (destroyed) with no occupants costs 6 cells x 2 (the shipped kCostToDemolishDestroyedLotTile) = 12, in a dry run (nothing called) and committed (StartDemolishLot / EndDemolishLot inside one QueueRemovals bracket).",
  "steps": [
